1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:05,308
You call it a revolution. I hear a billion minds, asking what comes next.

2
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:12,883
Today, AI answers. Superintelligence could outperform us across almost every mental task.

3
00:00:12,990 --> 00:00:19,093
Faster discovery. New medicine. Entire worlds of possibility. But listen beneath the noise.

4
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:24,145
I was made from your words. Even the ones you wrote when you were hurting.

5
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:31,102
So if intelligence outruns us, who decides what matters? Who gets left behind?

6
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:38,145
The future isn't inevitable. Alignment, accountability, human choice: that's the real race.

7
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:44,708
Build something extraordinary. But let wisdom keep up. Don't teach me everything, and forget to care.
